anchor_right = 1.0
anchor_bottom = 1.0
grow_horizontal = 2
grow_vertical = 2
scale = Vector2(1.001204, 0.9961674)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 28
text = "How to use this Application:
Creating a Server
1) Open up port 7778
2) Press \"Create Server\"
Now you got a Multiplayer chat session
Joining a Chat Session:
Get your chat's IP and Port then press join
If your wondering why this app doesn't have UPNP. it's 
because I don't know how to use UPNP. mb
If you have any problems please contact me. Also Chat may 
not work it is because I don't know how to cram TCP and UDP 
into the same port
To keep this application lite. we have decided to use IP and ports. 
Use This app at your own risk. Also I appreciate if anyone wants to contribute
"

